{"id":"d12ffdb5e1b32a31","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-liar-not-provable.md","title":"裸 KF 中说谎者及其真理原子独立","display":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸 KF 中说谎者及其真理原子独立","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-liar-not-provable","aliases":["91-thm-liar-not-provable"],"display":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸 KF 中说谎者及其真理原子独立","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization]]","[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-KF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-liar-not-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-liar-not-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-liar-not-provable — 裸 KF 中说谎者及其真理原子独立"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edf61bb893ee0ba7\" href=\"?note=edf61bb893ee0ba7\" title=\"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization\">91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" href=\"?note=2bc4d1a14a37aabf\" title=\"91-df-maximal-fixed-point\">91-df-maximal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a> 的十三条真理公理及全语言归纳。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\">\\(\\lambda=\\neg T(l)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a> 的闭项说谎者，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\">\\(c=\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\)</span>；KF 不含 CONS。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 为极小固定点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\">\\(d=\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\ulcorner T(l)\\urcorner\">\\(e=\\ulcorner T(l)\\urcorner\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_g\">\\(X_g\\)</span> 是从后固定点种子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\{c,d,e\\}\">\\(A=\\{c,d,e\\}\\)</span> 单调超限闭包而得的固定点，不要求信息一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\lambda\\ \\land\\ \\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash T(\\overline c)\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg T(\\overline c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\lambda\\ \\land\\ \\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg\\lambda\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash T(\\overline c)\n\\ \\land\\ \\mathrm{KF}\\nvdash\\neg T(\\overline c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极小固定点没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，其经典闭包使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline c)\">\\(T(\\overline c)\\)</span> 假、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 真，故反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline c)\">\\(T(\\overline c)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\neg\\lambda\\)</span>。\n三元素种子是后固定点：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in J(A)\">\\(c\\in J(A)\\)</span> 由负真理原子子句及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in A\">\\(d\\in A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in J(A)\">\\(d\\in J(A)\\)</span> 由双重否定子句及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in A\">\\(e\\in A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in J(A)\">\\(e\\in J(A)\\)</span> 由正真理原子子句及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in A\">\\(c\\in A\\)</span>。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq J(A)\">\\(A\\subseteq J(A)\\)</span>，可作递增超限闭包。所得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_g\">\\(X_g\\)</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，经典闭包使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline c)\">\\(T(\\overline c)\\)</span> 真、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 假，反驳另两式。\n加入中间编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 保证使用的是原书一步生成算子的真正后固定点种子，不能直接把两元素种子当作一步自保持。\n加入 CONS 改变结论，KF+CONS 可证明经典外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，但仍不证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline c)\">\\(T(\\overline c)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.7 的过剩说谎者固定点构造、Theorem 15.15；Lemmas 15.16–15.19。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"edf61bb893ee0ba7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization]]","embed":false},